OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FMorning fog slow to clear but   
OL,8,Fonce it does, a fine chilly day        
OL,9,Ffollows with long sunny spells for     
OL,10,Fmost. Cloudier in Northern Ireland and 
OL,11,Fsouthwest England where occasionally   
OL,12,Fheavy rain and strong winds will push  
OL,13,Fin by afternoon.                       
OL,15,GTonight:FA band of heavy rain pushes   
OL,16,Fin from the west overnight, reaching   
OL,17,FWales and western areas of England and 
OL,18,FScotland by dawn. Dry and chilly       
OL,19,Ffurther east with clear spells.        
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
