OL,4,CBurnham to set out EU deal in Commons, 
OL,5,Cas Badenoch says Europe 'not market of 
OL,6,Cthe future'                            
OL,7,GAndy Burnham will set out the new UK-  
OL,8,GEU deal in the House of Commons this   
OL,9,Gafternoon, after it was agreed with    
OL,10,GEuropean leaders on Friday.            
OL,12,FThe deal includes a youth mobility     
OL,13,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on       
OL,14,FBritish food exports, and the linking  
OL,15,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems 
OL,16,F- see a recap here.                    
OL,18,FThe Conservatives have already said    
OL,19,Fthey would scrap the deal, which Kemi  
OL,20,FBadenoch has called "terrible".        
