OL,4,CRussian ships hit by Ukrainian drones  
OL,5,Coff Libya coast, Zelensky says         
OL,6,GA Russian warship was sunk by          
OL,7,GUkrainian drones off the coast of      
OL,8,GLibya on Sunday, President Volodymyr   
OL,9,GZelensky said.                         
OL,11,FThe attack also hit a second Russian   
OL,12,Fvessel, a cargo ship being used to     
OL,13,Ftransport weapons, the Ukrainian prime 
OL,14,Fminister claimed.                      
OL,16,FOn Sunday morning, the government that 
OL,17,Fcontrols eastern Libya said there had  
OL,18,Fbeen an explosion on the warship at    
OL,19,Fthe Benghazi port, while it was        
OL,20,Fdocking for fuel and supplies ahead of 
OL,21,Fits return to Russia.                  
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
