OL,4,CBurnham to tell MPs 'landmark' EU deal 
OL,5,Ccould make next decade 'much better'   
OL,6,GThe prime minister will tell           
OL,7,GParliament on Monday the "landmark"    
OL,8,Gdeal struck with the EU means there is 
OL,9,Ga "very real prospect" the next decade 
OL,10,Gcan be "much better" than the last one.
OL,12,FThe deal, which covers British food    
OL,13,Fexports, emissions trading and a youth 
OL,14,Fexperience scheme, is a "choice        
OL,15,Fbetween a broken status quo or         
OL,16,Fchange", Andy Burnham will tell MPs.   
OL,18,FHe will also call it "the single       
OL,19,Fbiggest growth measure to be delivered 
OL,20,Fin this parliament" - repeating his    
OL,21,Fclaim it could add #17bn to the        
OL,22,FBritish economy.                       
OL,23,D]CParliament and politics digest...G144
